  "prefLabel": "Rev 2908.01 Definitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 2908.01 Definitions.\n\n(a) “Installment payment agreement” means a written agreement between a taxpayer and the department pursuant to which the department agrees to allow the taxpayer to pay taxes, interest, and penalties owed by the taxpayer to the department over a period of time greater than 30 days.\n\nSource. #10680, eff 10-2-14; ss by #13660, eff 6-21-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev2900.html"
